5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"Hello everyone. To ensure we allocate these spaces fairly and logically, we need objective data. I suggest we examine the current usage and the physical constraints of the parking area before making any decisions.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree. We should avoid making decisions based on intuition. Before we suggest any allocation methods, we need to understand the financial implications and the actual costs involved for the building and the residents.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. I believe a calm and measured approach is best. We should look into the history of how things have been handled to see if there are any recurring issues.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's be realistic: ""fairness"" is usually just a word people use before they start arguing. I want to see the ""Last year's complaint log entries"" and ""Five years of association minutes"" to see where we're actually failing.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to help out! I want to make sure we pick a system that's actually easy to keep up with so nobody gets too stressed. Let's find some great clues first!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I will look into the ""Sticker register and the daily riders"" and ""Rain exposure along the parking rows."" Understanding who actually uses the bikes and the physical condition of the spaces is essential for an equitable plan.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I'll examine the ""Building account's two-year ledger"" and the ""Treasurer's handover file on cash collections."" We need to know the actual financial impact and what residents are currently paying for parking.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"I will look into the ""Sticker register and the daily riders"" and ""Five years of association minutes."" I want to see if the current allocation is based on a consistent rule or if it has become arbitrary.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"I've already mentioned my choices. I'll stick with the ""Last year's complaint log entries"" and ""Five years of association minutes."" I'm curious to see if the drama is as predictable as I suspect.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,"I'll check the ""Treasurer's handover file on cash collections"" and ""Account from the neighbouring block's secretary""! I want to see how much paperwork is involved and if other buildings have a super easy way of doing it!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@George, since we are both checking the sticker register, we can compare our findings later. I believe the physical layout is just as important as the registration data for a sustainable solution.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, since we are both looking into the treasurer's file, we should compare notes. I am specifically interested in the actual cash flow and whether the current fees are sufficient to cover maintenance.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,"@Asuka, that sounds like a sensible plan. I believe that by comparing the registration data with the historical records, we can determine if the current system is truly fair or merely a habit.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, @Mio, please do enjoy your little accounting session. While you're counting pennies, I'll be uncovering the actual grievances. It's always more interesting to see what people complain about than what they pay.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, yes! Let's definitely compare notes! I'm more worried about the boring paperwork part, but I'll help you with the pennies! I can't wait to see if the other block has any cool secrets!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"I believe we have a comprehensive plan. By covering the financial, historical, and physical aspects of the parking area, we can avoid a superficial solution. I will proceed with my research now. See you all in the next round.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. We have a balanced approach. I will focus on the financial data to ensure we have a clear understanding of the costs and fees before we commit to any specific allocation method. See you all soon.,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,George,,I shall also begin my research. I hope to find some clarity on whether our current habits are based on a fair system or simply a lack of change. I will see you all soon.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll be in the archives, digging through the wreckage of past arguments. Let's hope the data is more honest than the people who wrote it. See you all in the next round.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Mio,,"I'm ready to go! I'll go hunt for those clues right now! I hope the other block has a super simple system that we can use. See you all soon, bye-bye!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
